      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"what you make next\"... but there's nothing left to make. i don't think i'm just in a slump. i think the well is dry for good. it feels like i'm just a shell walking around waiting for the clock to run out. do you ever feel like there's just no point in trying to refill a well that's cracked?",
